D or arrows to move and Space to dash; mobile has a touch stick and Dash button. Collect loot automatically and return to the dumpster to bank it.","Game platform","Browser","Guide format","build log","tutorial","Build story / tutorial",[203],{"_51":204,"_26":65,"_179":-7},"Read the creator’s full build walkthrough","Study this workflow","ordered",true,[209,210,211,212],"Play a night and test movement, loot pickup, carrying limits, banking, and getting caught.","Read the creator’s walkthrough of the prompt, art generation, and GitHub Pages workflow.","Use the build notes to study the playable core, mobile rendering fixes, and guard-dog behavior.","Serve the full game locally and compare its code and assets with the documented decisions.","AI workflow / foundation context","The creator publishes the prompt, Claude Code session, generated textures, and build notes. Claude implemented the game and tested it; the author reviews its strengths and gameplay limitations.","aiUse","Creation category","AI-assisted (creator attribution)","category","Asset creation tools",false,[223],"assetTools","gpt-image-2","Engine",[223],"ai-assisted",[209,210,211,212],{"_51":204,"_26":65,"_18":237},{"_51":194,"_26":153,"_18":190,"_179":195},{"_51":186,"_26":187,"_235":236,"_179":188},{"_51":177,"_26":178,"_179":180},[117,233,234],"threejs","playwright-mcp","scope","complete-project","build-log",{"_239":240},"documents",{"_241":242,"_243":244},"en",[246,250,251,252,249,253,254,255,256,257,258,259,260,261,262,263,264,265,266,267,268,269,270,271,272,273,274,275,276,277,278,279,280,281,282,283,284,248,285,247,286,287,288,289,290,291,292,293,294,295,296,297,298,299,300,301,302,303,304,305,306],"zh",[245,246,247,248,249],"reading-guide","practical-guide","level-design-skill","deployment","publishing-platforms","tutorials-and-demos","coding-agent-game-code","game-testing-library","agents-notes","engines-notes","game-ai-notes","cadle-repositories","world-model-notes","research-index","production-r